# 海报 PNG 是 CI 时通过 puppeteer 自动生成的产物（scripts/render-mp-posters.mjs）
# 不 commit 到仓库，避免 PNG bloat git 历史
# - 有 mp-article 的 bootcamp → mp-article/images/
# - 没有 mp-article 的 bootcamp → xhs-posters/images/
*/public/mp-article/images/
*/public/xhs-posters/images/

# 视频 MP4 放 S3，不进 git（GitHub 50MB 限制 + 媒体文件不该进 git）
# 生产地址：https://jr-image.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com/video/ai-engineer-short.mp4
# 重新生成：cd video-ai-engineer && bun run render && bun run upload
*/public/video/*.mp4
video-ai-engineer/out/
cca-f-cert-pack/video-digital-teacher-pilot/out/
cca-f-cert-pack/video-digital-teacher-pilot/.venv*/

# Outline restructure backups — kept locally for safety net, not committed
*/public/outline.json.*.bak

# Claude Code subagent isolated worktrees (ephemeral, not committed)
.claude/worktrees/

# Anthropic 官方考纲原件（4 门）= 版权材料，只做本地 ground truth，不进 git
